[32m+[m[32m# Mango identification API[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFastAPI server that takes photos of one tree, runs each through the fruit or leaf model on Triton, averages the scores, and returns a ranked list of cultivars. It is stateless: to refine a result, the app re-sends every photo.[m
